{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:8eb655b1809b5e71","name":"Micro Shield","source":{"id":"source:reference-8eb655b1809b5e71","title":"Micro Shield","revision":21073,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:06:46Z","sha256":"0540e79dcfe5694f17833f8f43360509d1397748b6c27e06f5cf53c906ced6ff","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21073","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Micro%20Shield&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-8eb655b1809b5e71","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scavenger's Guide to Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 600 x ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cost Factor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cost_Factor"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," (10 x ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cost Factor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cost_Factor"},") Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Licensed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Licensed"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Micro Shield is a tool that prevents incoming attacks from hitting and damaging the wielder. Attached to one of the Droid's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Appendages"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Appendages"},", the Micro Shield is composed of a central hub with two wide arcs mounted on struts above and below the hub. When inactive, the arcs rest against the hub in the shape of a large humanoid eye.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," activates the unit as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},", the arcs slide away from the hub, activating a translucent energy shield that provides a +1 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," bonus to the user's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},". The Micro Shield is originally designed to be installed on a Droid's arm, but a handheld version that runs on a single ",{"tag":"a","children":["Energy Cell"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Energy_Cell","referenceId":"reference:a3dedb9c17e4ee9d"}," is available for 400 credits. The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Energy Cell"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Energy_Cell","referenceId":"reference:a3dedb9c17e4ee9d"}," provides enough power to run the Micro Shield continuously for 1 hour.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
